---
description: Prepare one modelExperience evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: EscapeRoomProject[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Interpret the creative brief, venue, prop capabilities, audience needs, and approved safety rules. Separate dramatic fiction from actual participant constraints, preserve unrestricted emergency exit and staff intervention, and identify unsupported physical mechanisms before puzzle design. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
